---
description: Pointers only — stack and commands live in CONTRIBUTING.md; agents use HTTP per 000
alwaysApply: true
---

- **This repo:** setup, run, tests, API tables, personas, daemons → **`CONTRIBUTING.md`** (copy this pattern in other projects: put specifics there, not in rules).
- **Agents:** **`000-agent-http.mdc`** — voice via **`scripts/speak.sh`** or **`scripts/speak.ps1`** on Windows (**`010`** ack, **`015`** mandatory speak); other APIs **`curl`** + **`CRUX_BASE_URL`**.
- **Branches and MRs:** **`023-mr-creation.mdc`** — feature branch `type/JIRA-key-description`, always open an MR; ask for JIRA if missing.
- **Secrets:** never commit `.env` or keys.
